{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ84eJuMr21HLJosn8dL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HpwbzhoD1o2sv2Vn2guHYf","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-HWd2jU/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>半山烘焙所 · Halfhill Roastery</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"半山烘焙所是一家独立咖啡烘焙工作室，小批量烘焙当季单一产地咖啡豆。\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#top\">半山<span>烘焙所</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n        <a href=\"#beans\">咖啡豆</a>\n        <a href=\"#philosophy\">烘焙理念</a>\n        <a href=\"#visit\">到店</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"top\">\n    <!-- 首屏 -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container hero-inner\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Small-batch Coffee Roastery · Est. 2019</p>\n        <h1>每一锅豆子，<br>都只烘十二公斤。</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">\n          我们是一间藏在老街巷里的独立烘焙工作室。只选当季生豆，小批量烘焙，\n          让每一支豆子都留住它产地本来的味道。\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#beans\">看看本季豆单</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#visit\">来店里坐坐</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 豆单 -->\n    <section id=\"beans\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Current Offerings</p>\n          <h2>本季豆单</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-intro\">每周二、周五出炉，烘焙后静置 5–7 天风味最佳。所有豆子均可选择整豆或按冲煮方式现磨。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bean-grid\">\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-swatch swatch-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bean-body\">\n              <div class=\"bean-meta\"><span class=\"tag\">浅烘</span><span>埃塞俄比亚 · 耶加雪菲</span></div>\n              <h3>花语 Kochere</h3>\n              <p class=\"notes\">茉莉花 · 柠檬皮 · 蜂蜜红茶</p>\n              <dl class=\"specs\">\n                <div><dt>处理法</dt><dd>水洗</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>海拔</dt><dd>1,900–2,100m</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>推荐</dt><dd>手冲</dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"price\">¥98 <small>/ 200g</small></p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-swatch swatch-medium\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bean-body\">\n              <div class=\"bean-meta\"><span class=\"tag\">中浅烘</span><span>哥伦比亚 · 薇拉</span></div>\n              <h3>果园 Huila</h3>\n              <p class=\"notes\">红苹果 · 焦糖 · 可可尾韵</p>\n              <dl class=\"specs\">\n                <div><dt>处理法</dt><dd>厌氧日晒</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>海拔</dt><dd>1,750m</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>推荐</dt><dd>手冲 / 冷萃</dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"price\">¥88 <small>/ 200g</small></p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-swatch swatch-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bean-body\">\n              <div class=\"bean-meta\"><span class=\"tag\">中深烘</span><span>拼配 · 巴西 × 危地马拉</span></div>\n              <h3>半山 House Blend</h3>\n              <p class=\"notes\">黑巧克力 · 烤坚果 · 红糖</p>\n              <dl class=\"specs\">\n                <div><dt>处理法</dt><dd>日晒 / 水洗</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>风格</dt><dd>醇厚平衡</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>推荐</dt><dd>意式 / 奶咖</dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"price\">¥72 <small>/ 250g</small></p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 烘焙理念 -->\n    <section id=\"philosophy\" class=\"section section-alt\">\n      <div class=\"container philosophy\">\n        <div class=\"philosophy-text\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Our Approach</p>\n          <h2>烘焙理念</h2>\n          <blockquote>\n            “好的烘焙不是给豆子加上味道，<br>而是把它本来就有的味道带出来。”\n          </blockquote>\n          <p>\n            我们相信，一杯咖啡的风味在生豆离开产地时就已经写好了。烘焙师要做的，是读懂它，\n            然后用恰到好处的火候把它讲出来——不多，也不少。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <ol class=\"principles\">\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>只选当季</h3>\n              <p>与产区的小农和合作社直接往来，生豆到港后 6 个月内烘完，绝不囤放陈豆。</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>小批量烘焙</h3>\n              <p>一台 12 公斤的老式半热风烘豆机，每一锅都记录曲线，每一批都杯测后才上架。</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>新鲜送达</h3>\n              <p>按订单烘焙，出炉 48 小时内寄出。包装袋上写着烘焙日期，而不是保质期。</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 到店 -->\n    <section id=\"visit\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container visit\">\n        <div class=\"visit-info\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Visit Us</p>\n          <h2>到店地址</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-intro\">工作室一楼是烘焙间，二楼留了几张桌子。周末下午常有免费杯测，欢迎来闻闻刚出炉的豆子。</p>\n\n          <dl class=\"info-list\">\n            <div>\n              <dt>地址</dt>\n              <dd>某某市某某区梧桐巷 18 号（老邮局旁）</dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>营业时间</dt>\n              <dd>周三至周日 10:00 – 19:00<br><span class=\"muted\">周一、周二为烘焙日，暂停营业</span></dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>交通</dt>\n              <dd>地铁 2 号线「梧桐路站」B 口步行约 5 分钟</dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>联系</dt>\n              <dd>电话 000-0000-0000<br>邮箱 hello@example.com</dd>\n            </div>\n          </dl>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"map-card\" aria-label=\"位置示意图\">\n          <div class=\"map-grid\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"road road-h\"></span>\n            <span class=\"road road-v\"></span>\n            <span class=\"road road-h2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"pin\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"map-caption\">梧桐巷 18 号 · 找门口那棵老梧桐树</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <p class=\"logo\">半山<span>烘焙所</span></p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">© 2026 Halfhill Roastery · 慢慢烘，好好喝。</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34030,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34030},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73da4359-0e7a-4bcc-957e-dd3d974254d6","uuid":"7cf07893-c50c-409f-8aae-55bff65f3e56","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:16:43.841Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ84csM4gncP7uUWF4SU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01HpwbzhoD1o2sv2Vn2guHYf":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-HWd2jU/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>半山烘焙所 · Halfhill Roastery</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"半山烘焙所是一家独立咖啡烘焙工作室，小批量烘焙当季单一产地咖啡豆。\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#top\">半山<span>烘焙所</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n        <a href=\"#beans\">咖啡豆</a>\n        <a href=\"#philosophy\">烘焙理念</a>\n        <a href=\"#visit\">到店</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"top\">\n    <!-- 首屏 -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container hero-inner\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Small-batch Coffee Roastery · Est. 2019</p>\n        <h1>每一锅豆子，<br>都只烘十二公斤。</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">\n          我们是一间藏在老街巷里的独立烘焙工作室。只选当季生豆，小批量烘焙，\n          让每一支豆子都留住它产地本来的味道。\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#beans\">看看本季豆单</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#visit\">来店里坐坐</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 豆单 -->\n    <section id=\"beans\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Current Offerings</p>\n          <h2>本季豆单</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-intro\">每周二、周五出炉，烘焙后静置 5–7 天风味最佳。所有豆子均可选择整豆或按冲煮方式现磨。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bean-grid\">\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-swatch swatch-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bean-body\">\n              <div class=\"bean-meta\"><span class=\"tag\">浅烘</span><span>埃塞俄比亚 · 耶加雪菲</span></div>\n              <h3>花语 Kochere</h3>\n              <p class=\"notes\">茉莉花 · 柠檬皮 · 蜂蜜红茶</p>\n              <dl class=\"specs\">\n                <div><dt>处理法</dt><dd>水洗</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>海拔</dt><dd>1,900–2,100m</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>推荐</dt><dd>手冲</dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"price\">¥98 <small>/ 200g</small></p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-swatch swatch-medium\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bean-body\">\n              <div class=\"bean-meta\"><span class=\"tag\">中浅烘</span><span>哥伦比亚 · 薇拉</span></div>\n              <h3>果园 Huila</h3>\n              <p class=\"notes\">红苹果 · 焦糖 · 可可尾韵</p>\n              <dl class=\"specs\">\n                <div><dt>处理法</dt><dd>厌氧日晒</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>海拔</dt><dd>1,750m</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>推荐</dt><dd>手冲 / 冷萃</dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"price\">¥88 <small>/ 200g</small></p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-swatch swatch-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bean-body\">\n              <div class=\"bean-meta\"><span class=\"tag\">中深烘</span><span>拼配 · 巴西 × 危地马拉</span></div>\n              <h3>半山 House Blend</h3>\n              <p class=\"notes\">黑巧克力 · 烤坚果 · 红糖</p>\n              <dl class=\"specs\">\n                <div><dt>处理法</dt><dd>日晒 / 水洗</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>风格</dt><dd>醇厚平衡</dd></div>\n                <div><dt>推荐</dt><dd>意式 / 奶咖</dd></div>\n              </dl>\n              <p class=\"price\">¥72 <small>/ 250g</small></p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 烘焙理念 -->\n    <section id=\"philosophy\" class=\"section section-alt\">\n      <div class=\"container philosophy\">\n        <div class=\"philosophy-text\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Our Approach</p>\n          <h2>烘焙理念</h2>\n          <blockquote>\n            “好的烘焙不是给豆子加上味道，<br>而是把它本来就有的味道带出来。”\n          </blockquote>\n          <p>\n            我们相信，一杯咖啡的风味在生豆离开产地时就已经写好了。烘焙师要做的，是读懂它，\n            然后用恰到好处的火候把它讲出来——不多，也不少。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <ol class=\"principles\">\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>只选当季</h3>\n              <p>与产区的小农和合作社直接往来，生豆到港后 6 个月内烘完，绝不囤放陈豆。</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>小批量烘焙</h3>\n              <p>一台 12 公斤的老式半热风烘豆机，每一锅都记录曲线，每一批都杯测后才上架。</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>新鲜送达</h3>\n              <p>按订单烘焙，出炉 48 小时内寄出。包装袋上写着烘焙日期，而不是保质期。</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 到店 -->\n    <section id=\"visit\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container visit\">\n        <div class=\"visit-info\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Visit Us</p>\n          <h2>到店地址</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-intro\">工作室一楼是烘焙间，二楼留了几张桌子。周末下午常有免费杯测，欢迎来闻闻刚出炉的豆子。</p>\n\n          <dl class=\"info-list\">\n            <div>\n              <dt>地址</dt>\n              <dd>某某市某某区梧桐巷 18 号（老邮局旁）</dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>营业时间</dt>\n              <dd>周三至周日 10:00 – 19:00<br><span class=\"muted\">周一、周二为烘焙日，暂停营业</span></dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>交通</dt>\n              <dd>地铁 2 号线「梧桐路站」B 口步行约 5 分钟</dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>联系</dt>\n              <dd>电话 000-0000-0000<br>邮箱 hello@example.com</dd>\n            </div>\n          </dl>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"map-card\" aria-label=\"位置示意图\">\n          <div class=\"map-grid\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"road road-h\"></span>\n            <span class=\"road road-v\"></span>\n            <span class=\"road road-h2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"pin\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"map-caption\">梧桐巷 18 号 · 找门口那棵老梧桐树</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <p class=\"logo\">半山<span>烘焙所</span></p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">© 2026 Halfhill Roastery · 慢慢烘，好好喝。</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
